# Normalize every text file to LF, both in the repository and on checkout.
# Keeps Windows / WSL / Linux / Docker / CI working trees byte-identical, so
# diffs stay clean regardless of where the file was edited.
#
# `text=auto` lets git detect binary content itself, so binaries are never
# rewritten. This attribute also overrides a developer's global
# core.autocrlf setting for this repository.
* text=auto eol=lf
